  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Bring the <b>left and right corners</b> into the middle, folding gently but tightly around the stack.</li><li>Then the <b>bottom and top corners</b>, the same way. Tuck any loose rice in.</li><li>If it’s square, mark the cut direction — a grain of rice on top, in line with the filling.</li></ul>",
